  "title": "Tasty Tortellinis",
  "description": "Marinate boiled cheese tortellini in a delectable blend of red wine vinegar, olive oil and Dijon mustard seasoned with garlic, fresh basil, parsley and green onions. Chill thoroughly and serve as appetizers or toss with crunchy veggies in a salad.",
  "authors": [
